------p2mBoundary7f3a9c2b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="explanation"

Let ε>0. Apply OAI.PiExponent.pi_eventual_lower_bound at the exponent 2+ε/2>2, obtaining Q≥2 and q^{-(2+ε/2)}≤|π-p/q| for q≥Q. Such q satisfies q>1. Since -(2+ε)<-(2+ε/2), strict monotonicity of the real power of the base q gives q^{-(2+ε)}<q^{-(2+ε/2)}. Rewriting 1/q^{2+ε} as q^{-(2+ε)} and composing the inequalities proves the campaign's exact PiIrrationality.UpperBound 2 statement.
------p2mBoundary7f3a9c2b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Sol_PiIrrationality_openai_bound_two_transfer_graph_bridge.lean"
